{"product":{"id":8491215028563,"title":"KEVIN.MURPHY KILLER.CURLS WASH","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNOURISHING CURL OAT MILK SHAMPOO \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBY KEVIN MURPHY\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eA nourishing Oat Milk shampoo that gently cleanses hair while protecting the cuticle. Its ingredients, rich in fatty acids, preserve the hair’s strength and retain moisture to enhance texture for healthy, shiny hair.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHydrating \u0026amp; nourishing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEnhances curl \u0026amp; refines texture\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIdeal for both naturally curly \u0026amp; permed hair\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSmooths curls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eColour-safe\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVegan\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eApply to wet hair and massage into hair and scalp. Rinse and repeat.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Shampoo","created_at":"2023-08-08T17:37:06+03:00","handle":"killer-curls-wash","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:29+03:00","published_at":"2023-08-08T17:37:06+03:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"kevin.murphy","variants":[{"id":46941136224595,"product_id":8491215028563,"title":"250ml","price":"27.00","sku":"KM-KILLCURLWASH-250ML","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","o